5,5in DP. Removed casing slips and installed DP slips. Cleared rig floor</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-10-05T03:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-10-05T03:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">2049</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- cement plug</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>RIH w/ 7in tubing on 5,5in DP from 2049m to 2291. Average RIH speed 485m/hour</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-10-05T03:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-10-05T03:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">2291</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- cement plug</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Filled pipe</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-10-05T03:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-10-05T04:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">2616</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- cement plug</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>RIH w/ 7in tubing on 5,5in DP from 2291m to 2616m. Average RIH speed 650 m/hour</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-10-05T04:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-10-05T04:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">2616</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- cement plug</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Performed Pre-job Meeting prior to circulating well to sea water</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-10-05T04:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-10-05T06:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">2616</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- cement plug</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Started to circulate well to sea water. Staged up pumps to 3000 l/min - 78bar. Observed dirty fluid in returns. OIW reading is above 100ppm. No gas. After 50m3 pumped pulled 3m above combination wiper plug. Continued circulating. Shakers overflowed, reduced the rate to 2200l/min - 56bar. Circulated additional 112 m3. Observed clear returns after total of 162 m3 pumped. OIW content less than 30 ppm. Stopped pumps. Installed pump in sub w/ LT valve.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-10-05T06:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-10-05T06:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">2614</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- cement plug</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>R/B 1x stand. Installed side entry sub assembly and connected cement hose, spaced out to 2614m bottom of tubing string</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-10-05T06:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-10-05T07:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">2614</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- cement plug</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Lined up/prepared to pump wash pill</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-10-05T07:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-10-05T07:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">2614</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- cement plug</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Performed Pre-job Meeting to place pump balance cement plug</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-10-05T07:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-10-05T08:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">2614</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- cement plug</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Pumped 20m3 wash pill with mud pumps, 2700l/min - 79bar. Applied 20 bar behind IBOP, verified line up</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-10-05T08:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-10-05T09:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">2416</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- cement plug</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Balanced cement plug (2616 m - 2416 m ): Mixed and pumped 9,4 m3 of 1,9 SG cement slurry, 600 l/min. Displaced the cement to the rig floor with 2900 l of drill water. Zeroed volume counters. Displaced the cement with 37 m3 (1670 strokes) of SW, 2900 l/min/ 51 bar. Pulled out of cement to 2416m at 4 min/stand. Theoretical TOC 2416 m MD.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-10-05T09:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-10-05T10:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">2372</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- cement plug</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Installed sponge ball. Pumped 10m3 hi-vis at 2400l/min / 43 bar. Circulated out cement at max of 3400 l/min/ 116 bar. Diverted returns overboard. L/D pup joint and R/B 1x stand to 2372m. Meanwhile WOC</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-10-05T10:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-10-05T10:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">2372</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- cement plug</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Performed Pre-job Meeting to wash BOP w/ jetting tool. Meanwhile WOC</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-10-05T10:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-10-05T12:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">2372</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- cement plug</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Installed closed FOSV and BOP wash tool, made 10x passes in BOP and well head  area at 1500 LPM / 12 bar, operated rams and annular once. L/D BOP wash tool. Meanwhile WOC</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-10-05T12:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-10-05T12:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">2372</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Performed Pre-job Meeting to L/D DP. Meanwhile WOC</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-10-05T12:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-10-05T14:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">2052</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Installed pipe deck rollers. POOH and L/D singles of 5,5in DP from 2372m to 2052m. Meanwhile WOC</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-10-05T14:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-10-05T14:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">2052</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- cement plug</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Removed DP slips and installed master bushing. Meanwhile WOC</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-10-05T14:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-10-05T14:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">2052</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- cement plug</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Performed Pre-job Meeting to R/U casing tong. Meanwhile WOC</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-10-05T14:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-10-05T15:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">2049</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- cement plug</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>R/U casing tong and broke off swedge from top of tubing string. Meanwhile WOC</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-10-05T15:15: