anwhile WOC</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-10-05T19:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-10-06T00:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">2365</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Cleaned in moonpool. Worked to service both PRSs and TDS. Installed drill pipe slips. Meanwhile WOC</witsml:comments></witsml:activity>
